{"unit_id":"tuoLuoSuan__dsh-peak#card-zh","repo":"tuoLuoSuan/dsh-peak","commit":"c92e6ee369ec303c865286a996e163425925d3dc","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-peak 是一款 DSH 网页端插件，会在对话输入框左侧显示 DeepSeek 当前处于高峰价还是空闲价。它根据北京时间、工作日规则和内置的 2026 年中国节假日表计算状态，并展示计费档位、下次切换时间和判断理由。用户可设置切换前提醒时间，也可选择浏览器系统通知。适合想在发送请求前快速了解 DeepSeek 当前价格时使用；无需 API 密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:228","client.js:1166","client.js:1335"]}
{"unit_id":"tuoLuoSuan__dsh-peak#card-en","repo":"tuoLuoSuan/dsh-peak","commit":"c92e6ee369ec303c865286a996e163425925d3dc","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-peak adds a badge beside the DSH composer showing DeepSeek peak or off-peak pricing. It calculates status from Beijing time and a built-in 2026 holiday table, then shows the rate and next switch. Users can set advance alerts and browser notifications. No API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:228","client.js:1166","client.js:1335"]}
