{"unit_id":"tuoLuoSuan__dsh-peak#feature-1","repo":"tuoLuoSuan/dsh-peak","commit":"c92e6ee369ec303c865286a996e163425925d3dc","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-peak 的功能「峰谷状态徽标」：在对话输入框左侧显示当前 DeepSeek 高峰价或空闲价。状态按北京时间、工作日时段和内置节假日表计算，点击徽标可查看档位、下次切换和判定理由。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:228","client.js:1166","client.js:1374"]}
{"unit_id":"tuoLuoSuan__dsh-peak#feature-2","repo":"tuoLuoSuan/dsh-peak","commit":"c92e6ee369ec303c865286a996e163425925d3dc","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-peak 的功能「切换前提醒」：插件按所选提前量检查下一次峰谷边界，并在页面右下角显示提醒。提前时间可设为关闭或 1、2、5、10、15、30 分钟，默认两分钟。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:357","client.js:821","client.js:995"]}
{"unit_id":"tuoLuoSuan__dsh-peak#feature-3","repo":"tuoLuoSuan/dsh-peak","commit":"c92e6ee369ec303c865286a996e163425925d3dc","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-peak 的功能「可选系统通知」：用户在卡片中勾选并授予浏览器通知权限后，峰谷即将切换时可收到系统通知；界面会说明权限被拒或接口不可用的状态。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:893","client.js:968","client.js:1077"]}
{"unit_id":"tuoLuoSuan__dsh-peak#caveat-1","repo":"tuoLuoSuan/dsh-peak","commit":"c92e6ee369ec303c865286a996e163425925d3dc","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-peak 在浏览器本地按时钟和内置节假日表计算，不调用外部服务；提醒偏好保存在 localStorage，系统通知需浏览器权限。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:56","client.js:855","client.js:876","client.js:968"]}
